## 6. Navigation / UX

- Bottom navigation switches between Overview, Positions, Orders, Platforms and Security without a full page navigation.
- Header title changes according to the selected tab.
- Backend status remains visible at the top of the dashboard.
- Shared loading screens cover session checking, redirecting, and initial dashboard loading.
- Shared empty/error/status states are implemented for major data sections.
