## 13. Maintenance Rule

When changing FE behavior:

1. Update the relevant section in this document.
2. Keep feature names aligned with the UI labels.
3. Record environment-specific behavior explicitly when it affects save/test/order execution.
4. Keep the API inventory synchronized with controller changes.
5. Do not store real credentials, API secrets, private keys, tokens, or OTP values in this document.
